    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb four/five bedroom detached residence ideally located at Forth View, Foulksmills, offering spacious and well maintained accommodation in a peaceful setting just a short stroll from Foulksmills Village.\n\nThis attractive home is presented in excellent condition throughout and sits on beautifully landscaped gardens, providing both privacy and generous outdoor space. The property is further enhanced by a detached triple garage, ideal for storage, hobbies or additional parking, with excellent potential for conversion to additional living accommodation (subject to the necessary planning permission).\n\nApproached via a feature stone wall entrance, the home benefits from a tarmac driveway with ample parking. Internally, the property offers bright and flexible living accommodation suited to modern family living, including a sunroom that overlooks the gardens and the option of a home office or fifth bedroom. Oil fired central heating ensures comfort year round.\n\nConveniently located just 20 minutes drive from both Wexford Town and New Ross, the property enjoys easy access to a range of schools, sports clubs and the many amenities that County Wexford has to offer.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality home in a convenient Village location, combining countryside charm with everyday accessibility.\n\nVirtual tour online."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.25m x 3,96m\nStairs to landing, carpet to floor.\n\nLiving Room - 5.17m x 4.64m\nFeature bay window, open solid fuel fireplace.\n\nOffice /Bedroom - 2.85m x 2.7m\nCarpet to floor.\n\nMain Bedroom (ground floor) - 4.4m x 3.88m\nCarpet to floor, door to ensuite, door to walk in wardrobe.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.67m x 2.14m\nShelving, storage, carpet to floor.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.67m x 1.64m\nw.c w.h.b shower, tiled.\n\nMain Bathroom - 3.11m x 2.16m\nw.c. w.h.b shower, bath, fully tiled.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.84m x 4.13m\nCustom made fitted kitchen including Island, open plan to sun room, door to utility, tiled floors.\n\nUtility Room - 2.37m x 1.8m\nFitted unit, plumbed, oil burner, tiled floor, door to gardens.\n\nSun Room - 3.81m x 3.66m\nDouble doors to gardens.\n\nLanding - \nCarpet to floor.\n\nBathroom - 3m x 2.13m\nw.c. w.h.b. shower.\n\nBedroom - 4.42m x 3.28m\nCarpet to floor.\n\nBedroom - 4.73m x 2.84m\nCarpet to floor.\n\nBedroom - 5.95m x 3.55m\nPanoramic views, carpet to floor.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nTriple Garge - \nFeature L shaped triple garage with roller doors (one automated) and w.c. Option to convert subject to planning.\n\nPaddock/Gardens - \nStud rail paddock & Gardens.\n\n"
